        // return "This character has been charmed, and no longer has any control over their actions and is a puppet that has no choice but to obey a master. Wears off in [color=%negative%]" + this.m.TurnsLeft + "[/color] turn(s).\n\nThe higher a character\'s resolve, the higher the chance to resist being charmed.";
        mode = "pattern"
        en = "This character has been charmed, and no longer has any control over their actions and is a puppet that has no choice but to obey a master. Wears off in [color=%negative%]<turns:int>[/color] turn(s).\n\nThe higher a character's resolve, the higher the chance to resist being charmed."
        es = "Este personaje ha quedado encantado: ya no tiene ningún control sobre sus acciones y es un títere al que no le queda más remedio que obedecer a quien lo domina. El efecto desaparece en [color=%negative%]<turns>[/color] turno(s).\n\nCuanto mayor sea la Resolución de un personaje, mayor será la posibilidad de resistirse a ser Encantado."
    }
