        mode = "pattern"
        en = "The amount of coin your mercenary company has. Used to pay every mercenary daily at noon, as well as to hire new people and purchase equipment.\n\nYou pay out [color=%negative%]<dailyMoney:int>[/color] crowns per day. Your [color=%positive%]<money:int>[/color] crowns will last you for [color=%positive%]<time:int>[/color] more days."
        es = "La cantidad de monedas que tiene tu compañía de mercenarios. Se usa para pagar a cada mercenario diariamente al mediodía, así como para contratar personal y comprar equipo.\n\nPagas [color=%negative%]<dailyMoney>[/color] coronas al día. Tus [color=%positive%]<money>[/color] coronas te durarán [color=%positive%]<time>[/color] días más."
    }
