        mode = "pattern"
        en = "The amount of coin your mercenary company has. Used to pay every mercenary daily, as well as to hire new people and purchase equipment.\n\nYou pay out [color=%positive%]<dailyMoney:int>[/color] crowns per day.\n\n[color=%negative%]You have no more crowns to pay your fighters with! Earn some crowns fast or let some people go before they desert you one by one.[/color]"
        es = "La cantidad de monedas que tiene tu compañía de mercenarios. Se usa para pagar a cada mercenario diariamente, así como para contratar personal y comprar equipo.\n\nPagas [color=%positive%]<dailyMoney>[/color] coronas al día.\n\n[color=%negative%]¡No te quedan coronas para pagar a tus combatientes! Consigue coronas rápido o despide a parte de tu gente antes de que te abandonen uno a uno.[/color]"
