    // en = "Assorted arrows, bolts and throwing weapons used to automatically refill quivers after battle. Replacing one arrow or bolt will take up one point of ammunition, replacing one shot of a Handgonne will take up two points, and replacing one throwing weapon or charge of a Fire Lance will take up three. Running out of ammunition will leave your quivers empty and your people with nothing to shoot with. You can carry no more than <maxammo:int> units at a time."
    // en base_es
    // context: tooltip_events.o.general_queryUIElementTooltipData.desc
    {
        en = "Assorted tools and supplies to keep your weapons, armor, helmets, and shields in good condition. Running out of supplies may result in weapons breaking during combat and will leave your armor damaged and useless. More tools can be purchased in town or salvaged from equipment while camping."
        es = "Herramientas y suministros variados para mantener en buen estado tus armas, armaduras, cascos y escudos. Quedarte sin suministros puede hacer que las armas se rompan en combate y dejará tu armadura dañada e inútil. Puedes comprar más herramientas en las ciudades u obtenerlas desguazando equipo en el campamento."
    }
    // context: tooltip_events.o.general_queryUIElementTooltipData
    {
        en = "\nItems can be repaired while camping or out in the open. However, in that case, only one item can be repaired at a time per bro."
        es = "\nLos objetos pueden repararse en el campamento o a la intemperie. Sin embargo, en ese caso, cada hermano solo puede reparar un objeto a la vez."
