        en = "Swing both weapons in a wide arc. The right tile is hit by the main hand, the left tile by the off hand, and the middle tile by both weapons."
        es = "Blande ambas armas en un amplio arco. La mano principal golpea la casilla derecha, la mano secundaria la izquierda y ambas armas la del centro."
    }
