        en = "When transformed you will lose control of them, they will drop all their items and turn into a boar, with the ability to Charge and Gore. Their Stamina will triple, Health with double and Resolve will increase by 25%."
        es = "Al transformarse perderás el control del personaje: soltará todo su equipo y se convertirá en un jabalí, capaz de embestir y cornear. Su Fatiga máxima se triplicará, sus Puntos de vida se duplicarán y su Resolución aumentará un 25%."
    }
    // FILE: scripts\skills\injury_permanent\legend_arborthropy_injury.nut
